# Lines an AI coding assistant adds to commit messages and that must never reach a repository.
# One extended regular expression per line, matched case-insensitively against each message line.
# Used by claude-attribution.commit-msg (strips them) and claude-attribution.pre-push (refuses them).
^[[:space:]]*Co-Authored-By:.*(claude|anthropic)
^[[:space:]]*Claude-Session:
Generated with \[Claude Code\]
claude\.ai/code/session_
